  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has three purposes: 1) Develop a rigorous body of timely and accessible research on key issues within the education service delivery in Pakistan; 2) Promote the use of this research by policymakers and the govt to make informed policy and programming decisions and 3) Build the research capacities of local universities, think-tanks and research institutions to produce more robust research on education.</narrative>
